@Flatserve_HostAddress = http://localhost:5220

### All features
GET {{Flatserve_HostAddress}}/fgb/collection?userId=2&minX=4&minY=58&maxX=32&maxY=72
Accept: application/vnd.fgb

### Kristiansand centre
GET {{Flatserve_HostAddress}}/fgb/collection?userId=2&minX=7.95&minY=58.10&maxX=8.08&maxY=58.20
Accept: application/vnd.fgb

