Accept: application/vnd.fgb

### Filter by Brannvesen kristiansand
GET {{Flatserve_HostAddress}}/fgb/filter?value=Kristiansandsregionen%20BR&attribute=brannvesen
Accept: application/vnd.fgb

### Auth Polygon
